"manual_key\": \"safety-audit-export-escape-approval\", \"system\": \"manual\"}}, \"source_type\": \"decision\", \"record_kind\": \"advice_review\", \"applicability\": {\"state\": \"CURRENT\", \"revision_state\": \"CURRENT\", \"version_mode\": \"history\", \"enactment\": {\"status\": \"NOT_ENACTED\", \"missing\": [\"NOT_A_POLICY_CHANGE\", \"NO_ENACTMENT_EVIDENCE\"]}}, \"dates\": {\"source_date\": \"2026-09-23T14:00:00Z\", \"basis\": \"effective_at\", \"effective_at\": \"2026-09-23T14:00:00Z\", \"expired_as_of\": false}, \"scope\": {\"project_id\": \"safety_classification\", \"batch_id\": \"safety_batch_08\", \"scope\": \"project\", \"batch_relation\": \"same_batch\"}, \"authority\": {\"role\": \"TEAM_LEAD\", \"actor\": \"U006\", \"actor_relation\": \"RECORD_AUTHORITY\", \"approval_status\": \"EXPLICIT_SOURCE_MARKER\", \"provenance\": \"synthetic_manual_record\"}, \"authorship\": {\"verified\": false, \"basis\": \"NO_AUTHOR_RECORDED\"}, \"recorded_states\": {\"status\": \"tl_approved\", \"decision_status\": \"tl_approved\", \"execution_status\": \"not_executed\", \"outcome_status\": \"not_observed\"}, \"excerpt\": \"[PRIOR RECORD (advice_review; decision_status: tl_approved; execution_status: not_executed; outcome_status: not_observed) - history, not a standing rule.]\\n## Evidence available at review\\n\\nTwo archived audit rows failed JSON parsing: S08-EXP-004 contained a quotation mark inside a reviewer note, and S08-EXP-009 contained a line break. In each failed export the note had been inserted without the required JSON escaping. Both saved LT task records could still be opened, with their existing labels intact.\\n\\nThe export failure blocked a two-row audit transfer. No production task submission failure, lost rating, or incorrect safety label was established. The proposed engineering handoff includes these two synthetic rows; it has not yet been sent.\\n\\n## Prior ThreadSense advice\\n\\nEscalate the audit-export serializer with the two failing note examples, request correctly escaped JSON, and preserve the source ratings while the export is repaired.\"}, {\"evidence_id\": \"k:safety-audit-export-escape-outcome@1.0:4b0721f6\", \"origin\": \"retrieved_source\", \"use\": \"PRIOR_DECISION\", \"citation\": {\"authoring\": \"safety-audit-export-escape-outcome@1.0\", \"title\": \"Audit-export repair verified on the reported rows\", \"sections\": [\"Handoff and repair receipt\"], \"source\": {\"manual_key\": \"safety-audit-export-escape-outcome\", \"system\": \"manual\"}}, \"source_type\": \"decision\", \"record_kind\": \"follow_up\", \"applicability\": {\"state\": \"CURRENT\", \"revision_state\": \"CURRENT\", \"version_mode\": \"history\", \"enactment\": {\"status\": \"NOT_ENACTED\", \"missing\": [\"NO_TL_APPROVAL\", \"NOT_A_POLICY_CHANGE\", \"NO_ENACTMENT_EVIDENCE\"]}}, \"dates\": {\"source_date\": \"2026-09-24T17:00:00Z\", \"basis\": \"effective_at\", \"effective_at\": \"2026-09-24T17:00:00Z\", \"expired_as_of\": false}, \"scope\": {\"project_id\": \"safety_classification\", \"batch_id\": \"safety_batch_08\", \"scope\": \"project\", \"batch_relation\": \"same_batch\"}, \"authority\": {\"role\": \"TEAM_LEAD\", \"actor\": \"U006\", \"actor_relation\": \"RECORD_AUTHORITY\", \"approval_status\": \"NO_APPROVAL_MARKER\", \"provenance\": \"synthetic_manual_record\"}, \"authorship\": {\"verified\": false, \"basis\": \"NO_AUTHOR_RECORDED\"}, \"recorded_states\": {\"status\": \"reported\", \"decision_status\": \"reported\", \"execution_status\": \"fix_verified_in_sample\", \"outcome_status\": \"resolved_in_checked_rows\"}, \"excerpt\": \"[RELATED RECORD - not a search match: recorded backward link from safety-audit-export-escape-approval; series link from safety-audit-export-escape-approval.]\\n[PRIOR RECORD (follow_up; decision_status: reported; execution_status: fix_verified_in_sample; outcome_status: resolved_in_checked_rows) - history, not a standing rule.]\\n## Handoff and repair receipt (part 1/2)\\n\\nPriya sent the approved